<div id="app" class="storefront">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero-copy">
      <p class="section-kicker">花漾生活花店・台北</p>
      <h1 class="display">把喜歡的心意，<br>好好送到。</h1>
      <p class="home-hero-description">由花藝師挑選當令花材，為生日、相聚和每個想說謝謝的日子，親手完成一束花。</p>
      <a href="#products" class="button-primary home-hero-button">挑選一束花 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <div class="home-hero-promises"><span>台北市區當日配送</span><span>滿 NT$500 免運</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-hero-image">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487530811176-3780de880c2d?w=1400" alt="花藝師整理中的當季花束">
      <span class="hero-image-note">花材依季節供應<br><b>由花藝師每日挑選搭配</b></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shop-promises" aria-label="花店服務">
    <div><span class="promise-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span><b>當日挑選</b><small>每天新鮮進貨整理</small></span></div>
    <div><span class="promise-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span><b>花藝師手作</b><small>每束花仔細搭配包裝</small></span></div>
    <div><span class="promise-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span><b>安心送達</b><small>台北市區當日配送</small></span></div>
  </section>

  <section id="products" class="shop-section">
    <div class="shop-section-heading">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">為今天挑一束</p><h2 class="display">挑選花束</h2></div>
      <p>每一束都由花藝師依當日花況完成，<br class="hidden sm:block">花材和色彩會隨季節調整。</p>
    </div>

    <div v-if="loading" class="catalog-loading" role="status">正在整理今天的花束…</div>
    <template v-else>
      <div v-if="products.length === 0" class="empty-catalog"><p class="display">花架正在補上新鮮花材</p><p>稍後再回來，看看今天盛開的選擇。</p></div>
      <div v-else class="product-grid">
        <article v-for="(product, idx) in products" :key="product.id" class="product-card">
          <button @click="goToProduct(product.id)" class="product-image-link" :aria-label="'查看 ' + product.name + ' 商品詳情'">
            <span v-if="idx === 0 && pagination.page === 1" class="product-ribbon">當令花材</span>
            <img :src="product.image_url || featuredImages[idx % featuredImages.length]" :alt="product.name" class="product-image">
            <span class="product-quick-view">查看花束</span>
          </button>
          <div class="product-card-info">
            <button @click="goToProduct(product.id)" class="product-name">{{ product.name }}</button>
            <p class="product-card-description">{{ product.description || '當令花材・花藝師手作' }}</p>
            <div class="product-price-row"><span class="product-price">NT$ {{ product.price.toLocaleString() }}</span><span class="product-availability">{{ product.stock > 0 ? '新鮮製作' : '本日售完' }}</span></div>
            <button @click="addToCart(product)" :disabled="product._adding || product.stock <= 0" class="button-primary product-add-button">
              <svg v-if="!product._adding && product.stock > 0" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 4h2l2.1 10.1a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h7.8a2 2 0 0 0 1.9-1.5L20 8H6"/><circle cx="10" cy="20" r="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1"/><path d="M13 7v6M10 10h6"/></svg>
              {{ product.stock <= 0 ? '本日售完' : product._adding ? '正在加入…' : '加入購物車' }}
            </button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <nav v-if="pagination.totalPages > 1" class="catalog-pagination" aria-label="商品頁碼"><button v-for="p in pagination.totalPages" :key="p" @click="loadProducts(p)" :aria-current="p === pagination.page ? 'page' : null" :class="p === pagination.page ? 'is-current' : ''">{{ p }}</button></nav>
    </template>
  </section>

  <section class="atelier-note">
    <div class="atelier-note-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508610048659-a06b669e3321?w=1200" alt="花藝師在工作桌上整理花材"></div>
    <div class="atelier-note-copy"><p class="section-kicker">花漾生活的日常</p><h2 class="display">一束花，從<br>認真挑選開始。</h2><p>我們相信花不只是特別日子的禮物，也可以是讓普通一天變得明亮的小事。每天從花市挑回合適的花材，再一束一束完成。</p><a href="#products" class="text-link">看看今天的花束 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </section>
</div>
